{"slug":"digital-style-guide","url":"/blog/digital-style-guide","title":"12 Best Tools To Create A Digital Style Guide in 2026","category":"Logo Design","author":"Arek Dvornechuck","date":"Jan 27, 2026","readTime":"5 min read","image":{"src":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/657b69ca0200748e1043a80b_50bb7de8-e460-47be-b213-b00b2772d111.webp","alt":"12 Best Tools To Create A Digital Style Guide in 2026"},"seo":{"title":"12 Best Tools To Create A Digital Style Guide in 2026","description":"Discover the best tools to create digital style guides online in 2026. Compare Standards, Frontify, BrandPad & more.","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/657b69ca0200748e1043a80b_50bb7de8-e460-47be-b213-b00b2772d111.webp"},"description":"Discover the best tools to create digital style guides online in 2026. Compare Standards, Frontify, BrandPad & more.","body":"<p id=\"\">In 2026, creating <strong id=\"\">brand guidelines</strong> online has become the standard approach as brands embrace the advantages <strong id=\"\">over traditional PDFs</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">These are often called <strong id=\"\">digital style guides</strong>, <strong id=\"\">brand portals</strong>, or brand management platforms.</p><p id=\"\">The key benefit is that your <strong id=\"\">brand assets</strong> are instantly <strong id=\"\">accessible online</strong> to anyone on your team, eliminating version confusion, endless email threads, and attachment chaos.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:900px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"900px\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f53_657d0fd5a97de72f378a6354_Brand-Guidelines-Online-3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"PDF vs Online Brand Guidelines — Pros & Cons\" id=\"\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Think of a digital guide as a <strong id=\"\">dedicated website for your brand</strong> where team members and partners can easily download logos and access the latest brand updates.</p><p id=\"\">You can also <strong id=\"\">password-protect</strong> sensitive sections or share private links with specific collaborators.</p><p id=\"\">In this comprehensive guide, I compare the <strong id=\"\">top 12 tools</strong> for building <strong id=\"\">online style guides</strong> in 2026.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/657b69ca0200748e1043a80b_50bb7de8-e460-47be-b213-b00b2772d111.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">I'll share the <strong id=\"\">strengths and limitations of each</strong> platform based on my hands-on testing.</p><p id=\"\">You can also watch this <strong id=\"\">video breakdown</strong> on my YouTube channel:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-video w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" data-rt-type=\"video\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"\" data-rt-max-height=\"56.206088992974244%\" data-rt-dimensions=\"854:480\" data-page-url=\"https://youtu.be/L1XnAP3HL0c\"><div id=\"\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/L1XnAP3HL0c\" title=\"How To Create A Digital Style Guide (Best Tools)\"></iframe></div></figure><p id=\"\">Whether you're a design agency delivering brand identities or a startup building your own brand foundation, these tools will help you move beyond static PDFs into the <strong id=\"\">modern era of digital brand guidelines</strong>.</p><h2 id=\"f1c40fb5-94b6-495e-b423-f709cfbd800c\">1. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://Standards.site\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Standards</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://Standards.site\" id=\"\">Standards</a> tops my list—not because it's objectively the best, but because it perfectly fits my workflow with its intuitive interface, robust customization, and budget-friendly pricing.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f5f_657b69ca0200748e1043a8c5_35780aff-b580-4d44-b8ac-a8aae5d2193d.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"http://Standards.site\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Industry leaders like <strong id=\"\">Pentagram</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Gretel</strong>, and brands including <strong id=\"\">Cash App</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Skillshare</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Headspace</strong> trust Standards for their brand guidelines.</p><p id=\"\">Browse their <a href=\"https://standards.site/examples/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">style guide gallery</strong></a> for inspiration.</p><p id=\"\">The interface feels remarkably similar to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/webflow\" id=\"\">Webflow</a>—clean and intuitive.</p><p id=\"\">I was so impressed that I rebuilt my entire PDF guidelines using Standards—see it <a href=\"https://live.standards.site/ebaqdesign/\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">here</strong></a>.</p><p id=\"\">Here's a look at their editor:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f9f_657b69ca0200748e1043a8e9_6dd96496-6839-4ad7-94e9-88cce1886a22.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"https://live.standards.site/ebaqdesign/\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">The free tier includes a small \"<strong id=\"\">Made with Standards</strong>\" watermark.</p><p id=\"\">Premium plans start at just <strong id=\"\">$10/month</strong> to remove branding and unlock features like <strong id=\"\">password protection, project transfers, and custom domains</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">For my needs, Standards remains the ideal choice in 2026.</p><h2 id=\"7bf6b7ce-1351-4a21-8fb6-735a9776e1bf\">2. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandpad.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandPad</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandpad.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandPad</strong></a> is a premium option trusted by iconic brands like <strong id=\"\">IKEA</strong>, <strong id=\"\">MoMA</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">IDEO</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f56_657b69ca0200748e1043a8e5_3e4f301a-953d-4d46-9b91-baab494e06c5.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Start with a <strong id=\"\">21-day free trial</strong> to explore its capabilities.</p><p id=\"\">The interface is exceptionally <strong id=\"\">clean</strong> and <strong id=\"\">minimalist</strong>—clearly designed by designers, for designers.</p><p id=\"\">Read more about BrandPad's approach in this <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://the-brandidentity.com/resource/pdf-guidelines-are-dead-long-live-digital-guidelines-brandpad-is-helping-us-into-the-future\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">featured article</strong></a>.</p><p id=\"\">Choose to <strong id=\"\">build from scratch</strong> or select from their curated <strong id=\"\">template library</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Here's what building a guide looks like in BrandPad:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f5c_657b69ca0200748e1043a8be_9a3df1c7-1d25-4146-9edb-286f4656ba56.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">The tradeoff: the stripped-down interface has a steeper learning curve.</p><p id=\"\">However, you gain <strong id=\"\">exceptional creative control</strong> over every visual detail.</p><p id=\"\">Pricing starts at $42/month for 2 brand guidelines.</p><h2 id=\"c93a1f06-0fd1-429c-898b-72cfe92f5399\">3. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.frontify.com/en/\" id=\"\">Frontify</a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.frontify.com/en/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Frontify</strong></a> is an enterprise-grade platform used by global brands including <strong id=\"\">Uber, Microsoft, Lufthansa</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">KIA</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fa5_657b69ca0200748e1043a90e_eea51081-1349-4457-b0dd-6179ab8e85de.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">It centralizes all brand assets in one organized, shareable hub.</p><p id=\"\">Extensive integrations connect with <strong id=\"\">Figma</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Canva</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Slack</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Miro</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">The platform offers deep customization for complete creative freedom in designing your brand portal.</p><p id=\"\">Enterprise features include <strong id=\"\">webhooks</strong>, <strong id=\"\">APIs</strong>, and advanced access controls.</p><p id=\"\">Here's the Frontify interface:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fb4_657b69ca0200748e1043a8ce_10704cb9-9b3e-4aa4-bf4e-f6536278fead.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.frontify.com/en/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Frontify</strong></a> excels for <strong id=\"\">large organizations</strong> requiring complex workflows and deep system integrations.</p><p id=\"\">Start your <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.frontify.com/en/signup/?plan=STARTER&interval=YEARLY\" id=\"\">free trial here</a>.</p><h2 id=\"9cd70cf2-62ec-4e79-ba10-bf842993f565\">4. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.corebook.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Corebook</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.corebook.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Corebook</strong></a> powers brand guidelines for top agencies like <strong id=\"\">McCann</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Veyner Media</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Mackey Saturday</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fae_657b69ca0200748e1043a8de_39e8fcb2-ef68-4f47-b32f-6c1b506604af.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\" file=\"FabPYTWs11Du9S0umbdZz\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">The onboarding asks questions about your brand, then provides a visual builder for crafting your guide.</p><p id=\"\">More approachable than BrandPad for newcomers.</p><p id=\"\">The downside: you <strong id=\"\">start from a blank canvas</strong>, which takes more time than template-based alternatives.</p><p id=\"\">The upside: complete <strong id=\"\">design freedom</strong> without constraints.</p><p id=\"\">Here's Corebook's editor in action:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fb7_657b69ca0200748e1043a8f9_d726dd3e-6ee6-40c8-bf0c-9802f23d5484.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.corebook.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Corebook</strong></a> includes custom page <strong id=\"\">templates</strong>, <strong id=\"\">white labeling</strong>, and comprehensive <strong id=\"\">media support</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Direct imports from <strong id=\"\">Figma</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Adobe Suite</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Miro</strong> streamline your workflow.</p><p id=\"\">Unique feature: <strong id=\"\">Corebook Studio</strong> offers a <strong id=\"\">lifetime plan</strong>—pay once, use forever.</p><p id=\"\">Monthly subscriptions start at <strong id=\"\">$39/month</strong> for up to <strong id=\"\">5 projects</strong>, which you can share with clients or transfer ownership.</p><h2 id=\"a5707e59-2a28-43bd-8308-702f58acc59a\">5. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandingguide.app/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandingGuide</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandingguide.app/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandingGuide</strong></a> delivers a <strong id=\"\">streamlined</strong>, straightforward one-page style guide creator.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f62_657b69ca0200748e1043a8bb_8b1212df-58df-4814-9960-5ebc25041542.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Their gallery showcases <strong id=\"\">sample brand guidelines</strong> they've created for well-known companies.</p><p id=\"\">I built a draft guide in just minutes.</p><p id=\"\">The format includes two tabs—<strong id=\"\">Style Guide</strong> with brand information and <strong id=\"\">Brand Assets</strong> for file downloads.</p><p id=\"\">Best part: it's <strong id=\"\">completely free</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Check out my example <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandingguide.app/brand/3263acde13606f93e174e3d8a109aa4105fd4d50#\" id=\"\">here</a>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fe1_657b69ca0200748e1043a8e1_8a0e0baa-38f6-4643-8f95-bf3394b153f1.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">For a <strong id=\"\">quick, no-cost solution</strong> with minimal setup, BrandingGuide delivers.</p><h2 id=\"506c716e-8a4a-4e9b-bc2c-cb873039978d\">6. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://baseline.is/?gr_pk=vpkO&gr_uid=ABXp\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Baseline</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://baseline.is/?gr_pk=vpkO&gr_uid=ABXp\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Baseline</strong></a> takes a different approach than pure guideline creators.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fb1_657b69ca0200748e1043a8d7_18eb1ff4-1054-4e19-a17d-225cd02dd20a.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">It's a content creation platform—think <strong id=\"\">Canva meets brand guidelines</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Set up your brand identity, and Baseline automatically generates <strong id=\"\">on-brand templates</strong> and content.</p><p id=\"\">Once configured, create consistent <strong id=\"\">social media posts</strong> and graphics for <strong id=\"\">Instagram</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Facebook</strong>, <strong id=\"\">LinkedIn</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Pinterest</strong> using their template library.</p><p id=\"\">See my brand guidelines example <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://baseline.is/brand/jSxvCFxEnTSVdXw9QGacKU/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">here</strong></a>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fde_657b69ca0200748e1043a8cb_ab996a12-9cb7-4995-897f-4f190674ebd2.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Your brand colors, logos, and fonts automatically apply across all designs.</p><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://baseline.is/?gr_pk=vpkO&gr_uid=ABXp\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Baseline</strong></a> also generates CSS code and enables guide sharing.</p><p id=\"\">A free tier is available to get started.</p><h2 id=\"7994cc2e-6665-45f5-bc65-c2f3de02c9ca\">7. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.lingoapp.com/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Lingo App</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.lingoapp.com/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Lingo App</strong></a> combines digital brand guidelines with asset management, trusted by <strong id=\"\">Duolingo</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Reddit</strong>, <strong id=\"\">Bumble</strong>, and <strong id=\"\">Snapchat</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fa8_657b69ca0200748e1043a8d1_7b219899-2ae5-4a94-a377-1e5bb03cba60.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">The <strong id=\"\">Figma integration</strong> automates asset imports into Lingo.</p><p id=\"\">Upload an <strong id=\"\">SVG logo</strong> and it automatically generates <strong id=\"\">JPG</strong> and <strong id=\"\">PNG</strong> versions.</p><p id=\"\">Track asset downloads, manage access requests, and share private links.</p><p id=\"\">Here's my draft guide in Lingo:</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f65_657b69ca0200748e1043a8da_c9543a59-6978-4c84-9276-c6e9c6f732c1.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Features include <strong id=\"\">password protection</strong>, <strong id=\"\">custom domains</strong>, and up to <strong id=\"\">50GB storage</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Plans start at $30/month for up to 5 users.</p><h2 id=\"dc567834-a031-4510-bf67-6af7f7ee0d1a\">8. <a href=\"https://gingersauce.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Gingersauce</strong></a></h2><p id=\"dc567834-a031-4510-bf67-6af7f7ee0d1a\"><a href=\"https://gingersauce.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Gingersauce</strong></a> focuses on creating downloadable PDF style guides through an automated process.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fa2_657b69ca0200748e1043a8f5_0d16717a-cbff-48a2-a772-b3a1dbc94196.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\" file=\"OF2RWxrWMBT2WIl3XxFhv\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Upload logos, select fonts and colors, and the platform inserts everything into professional templates.</p><p id=\"\">It transforms style guide creation into a simple <strong id=\"\">fill-in-the-blank experience</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Answer a few questions and receive a polished <strong id=\"\">PDF</strong> for <strong id=\"\">online viewing</strong> or download.</p><p id=\"\">View my example <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://app.gingersauce.co/my/view/47213\" id=\"\">here</a>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f59_657b69ca0200748e1043a8c1_dd365a6c-4079-4839-8746-194813eb6744.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">No complex interface—just a straightforward path to a finished guide.</p><p id=\"\">For simple, automated PDF style guide creation, Gingersauce gets the job done efficiently.</p><h2 id=\"d3cad7ce-6287-4204-a6a4-6070cb0e7d4a\">9. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.flipsnack.com/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Flipsnack</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\">Flipsnack transforms your <strong id=\"\">existing PDF</strong> style guide into an engaging <strong id=\"\">online flipbook</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fe4_657b69ca0200748e1043a8f1_111ce010-d5a8-46e6-b4f3-710efa0334fe.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\" file=\"qcYPoPIpPx39KNL3RuGSJ\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Upload your current PDF and convert it into a polished <strong id=\"\">interactive web publication</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Flipsnack also includes design tools for creating <strong id=\"\">flipbooks from scratch</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Ideal if you want to digitize your static PDF while preserving your preferred layout and formatting.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2fab_657b69ca0200748e1043a912_5c39dac6-eaf6-41fd-bc93-4624a40784e5.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Flipsnack streamlines converting your <strong id=\"\">PDF into a professional online flipbook</strong>.</p><h2 id=\"\">10. <a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\">Bravemark</a></h2><p id=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Bravemark</strong></a> is a rising platform emphasizing <strong id=\"\">simplicity</strong> and <strong id=\"\">asset management</strong>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:960px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"960px\"><a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2ffd_676b246961721719f3d0cc09_bravemark2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" id=\"\"></div></a></figure><p id=\"\">The drag-and-drop builder creates responsive brand guidelines in <strong id=\"\">10 minutes or less</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Easily organize and share downloadable brand assets—perfect for designers working with clients who need quick material access.</p><p id=\"\">Choose between <strong id=\"\">private</strong> and <strong id=\"\">public sharing</strong>, plus showcase your work in their designer community.</p><p id=\"\">Pricing starts with a <a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">free plan</strong></a> (5 projects), while PRO at $10/month unlocks 15 projects with premium features like private publishing and asset downloads.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:960px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"960px\"><a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda3009_676b244ad6f25cb51c6943bc_bravemark.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" id=\"\"></div></a></figure><p id=\"\">I've partnered with <a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Bravemark</strong></a> to offer readers <strong id=\"\">30% OFF</strong> with code \"<strong id=\"\">EBAQDESIGN</strong>\".</p><p id=\"\">Bravemark's strength lies in <strong id=\"\">practicality and speed</strong>—the intuitive UI makes sense immediately whether you're converting a PDF or building from scratch.</p><h2 id=\"\">11. <a href=\"https://guidelines.online/\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\">Guidelines Online</a></h2><p id=\"\">I created <a href=\"https://guidelines.online/\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Guidelines.online</strong></a>—a free style guide generator still in beta.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/67772626978a64e038e8ae5f_6777178b7630b618d04377d2_guidelines_online_mockup.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" loading=\"auto\" id=\"\"></div></figure><p>I built guidelines.online to give clients quick, easy access to brand <strong>logos</strong>, <strong>colors</strong>, and <strong>fonts</strong> on any device, anywhere.</p><p id=\"\">Key features:</p><ol start=\"1\" id=\"\"><li id=\"\">Upload your <strong id=\"\">SVG</strong> logo</li><li id=\"\">Auto-generates <strong id=\"\">all-white</strong> and <strong id=\"\">all-black</strong> logo versions</li><li id=\"\">One-click <strong id=\"\">copy logos to clipboard</strong></li><li id=\"\">Automatically <strong id=\"\">detects colors</strong> from your logo</li><li id=\"\">Add <strong id=\"\">fonts</strong> and additional colors</li><li id=\"\">Custom URL: <strong id=\"\">guidelines.online/yourname</strong></li><li id=\"\">Unlimited guidelines</li></ol><p id=\"\">Sign in with Google and try it today!</p><h2 id=\"e31006a9-b1a1-4320-8586-1fa0c11f825b\">12. <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign Publish</strong></a></h2><p id=\"\">Here's a <strong id=\"\">free option</strong> for putting style guides online—if you're a designer using <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobecc\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Adobe CC</strong></a>, you already have <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign</strong></a>.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image \" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"\"><div id=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5de2db6d3719a1e2f3e4454c/676b2567cc820abf4dda2f68_657b69ca0200748e1043a8ed_8aa1678d-a872-461e-939d-81b92e64c885.webp\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"regular\" link=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" source=\"\" id=\"\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign</strong> includes a <strong id=\"\">built-in feature</strong> for publishing PDFs online at no extra cost.</p><p id=\"\">I've used it for years with clients including <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/sweetgrass-guidelines\" id=\"\">SweetGrass</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/periti-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Periti</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/medihuanna-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Medihuanna</a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/lyntics-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Lyntics</a>.</p><p id=\"\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign Publish</strong></a> converts print-ready PDFs into functional online publications.</p><p id=\"\">Not responsive, but clients get a <strong id=\"\">clickable PDF</strong> they can access online and copy text from (like color values).</p><p id=\"\">I include buttons to <strong id=\"\">download brand assets</strong> and <strong id=\"\">logo packages</strong> stored on <strong id=\"\">Dropbox</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">PS: Check out my <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/guidelines-kit\" id=\"\">Brand Guidelines Kit</a>—a template for quickly building PDF style guides in InDesign.</p><h2 id=\"091a3161-001b-43c2-9b22-5008f4479e3d\">Conclusion</h2><p id=\"\">In 2026, there are excellent options for creating digital brand guidelines.</p><p id=\"\">I favor <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://Standards.site\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Standards</strong></a> for its <strong id=\"\">intuitive interface</strong> and seamless PDF recreation experience.</p><p id=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.bravemark.co/?ref=ebaqdesign\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Bravemark</strong></a> is equally compelling—either works well.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Bravemark</strong> excels for <strong id=\"\">smaller projects</strong>, while <strong id=\"\">Standards</strong> offers advanced features for <strong id=\"\">larger clients</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Ultimately, the best platform depends on your <strong id=\"\">specific requirements and budget</strong>.</p><p id=\"\">Agencies and <strong id=\"\">enterprises</strong> may need advanced capabilities like white labeling, integrations, <strong id=\"\">robust customization</strong>, and access controls.</p><p id=\"\">For those needs, consider <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.frontify.com/en/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Frontify</strong></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandpad.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandPad</strong></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.corebook.io/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Corebook</strong></a>, or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.bynder.com/\" id=\"\">Bynder</a>.</p><p id=\"\">Note: I skipped <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.bynder.com/\" id=\"\">Bynder</a> as they don't offer trial access.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Smaller brands</strong> want <strong id=\"\">simplicity</strong> and affordability.</p><p id=\"\">For that, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brandingguide.app/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">BrandingGuide</strong></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.lingoapp.com/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Lingo App</strong></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.flipsnack.com/\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Flipsnack</strong></a>, or <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign Publish</strong></a> are excellent choices.</p><p id=\"\">Also watch my <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1GsWDRe2TMI\" id=\"\">YouTube video</a> explaining how I create <strong id=\"\">style guides from scratch</strong> (PDF).</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-video w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"padding-bottom:56.25%\" data-rt-type=\"video\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-height=\"56.25%\"><div id=\"\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1GsWDRe2TMI?rel=0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share;\"></iframe></div></figure><p id=\"\">I still deliver PDF style guides to clients, but now offer digital guidelines as well.</p><p id=\"\">If you prefer the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/go/adobeindesign\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">InDesign Publish</strong></a> approach, check out my <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/guidelines-kit\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Brand Guidelines Kit</strong></a>.</p><p id=\"\">It's the <strong id=\"\">InDesign template</strong> I use with clients (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/sweetgrass-guidelines\" id=\"\">SweetGrass</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/periti-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Periti</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/medihuanna-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Medihuanna</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/lyntics-brand-guidelines\" id=\"\">Lyntics</a>).</p><p id=\"\">Need a style guide for your brand?—<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ebaqdesign.com/contact\" id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">reach out</strong></a>.</p>","categorySlug":"logo-design","tags":["Logo Design"]}